  "id": "USN-8347-1",
  "summary": "qtwebengine-opensource-src vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the vendored LibTIFF in QT WebEngine incorrectly\nhandled memory when parsing malformed TIFF image metadata. An attacker\ncould possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service, obtain\nsensitive information, or execute arbitrary code.",
